From 4a46ad2971a9afcc37820f0721e5778bdcb4b76c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:03:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/78] Port the Use command of the Items screen and spell
 casting

H065+$2F82 (Use) and +$34FC (spell choice); H033 spell lists
($0366, $056E, $06C0, $07A4, $084C, $0C64, $0D7C), spell menu ($00EE),
target selection ($12D4), casting ($1426), scroll spell removal ($1836)
and announcement ($18EE); H063 $1DC2, $1EE8, $2F12 and the party member
picker $3A26; H062+$1780; H073 $1294 and $12AE.  H085 data used by
H033 get their own variables; H005 pointers $2508, $251C, $2520 and
$2770 become C globals.  Combat-only callees stay unported.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
